OL,3,AFilm festival celebrates British-Latino
OL,4,Aidentity
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn event billed as London's only
OL,7,Fcompetitive Latino film festival is now
OL,8,Funder way for the first time in the
OL,9,Fcapital.
OL,11,FVenues including the Barbican, the ICA,
OL,12,FCine Lumiere and BFI Stephen Street
OL,13,Fwill screen 60 films from 27 countries
OL,14,Funtil Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,169,160,200,105,0,100
