OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFilm festival celebrates British-Latino
OL,4,Aidentity
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere will also be workshops and
OL,7,Fperformances with guests including
OL,8,FCuban dancer Carlos Acosta, a former
OL,9,Fprincipal at the Royal Ballet,
OL,10,FArgentine actor Oscar Martinez, Cuban
OL,11,Factor Jorge Perugorria and
OL,12,FOscar-winning Chilean screenwriter
OL,13,FGonzalo Maza.
OL,15,FThe event was founded by Cuban actress
OL,16,FKetty Rodriguez who, when she moved to
OL,17,FLondon, was struck by the lack of Latin
OL,18,Frepresentation in a city famous for its
OL,19,Fmulticulturalism, film and history.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
